1... g4 (1... Kf5 { [%csl Gg2] } 2. Ra5+ Kg6 (2... Ke6 3. Ra6+ Kd5 4. Ra5+ Kc4 5. Ra4+ Kb3 6. Ra8 Kb2 7. Rb8+ Kc3 8. Rc8+ Kb4 9. Rb8+ Ka5 10. Ra8+ Kb6 { [%csl Gb8][%cal Ga8b8] } 11. Rb8+ (11. Ra3 g4 12. Kh2 g3+ 13. Kg2 { [%csl Rg2] }) 11... Ka7 { [%csl Ga1][%cal Ga2a1] }) 3. Ra4 g4 4. Ra3 g3 5. Ra6+ Kf5 6. Ra5+ Ke4 7. Ra4+ Kd3 8. Ra3+ Kc4 9. Ra8) 2. Ra8 (2. Ra6+ Kg5 (2... Kf7 3. Ra7+ Ke6 4. Ra6+ Kd5 5. Ra5+ Kc6 6. Ra6+ Kb5 7. Ra8 Kb4) 3. Ra5+ Kh4 4. Ra8 g3 5. Rh8+ Kg4) 2... g3 $10 3. Ra7 (3. Ra6+ $10 { also more than sufficient to split the point }) 3... Kf5 4. Ra8 Kf4 5. Ra7 $10 { Black can’t come close to winning. } *


