{ Black to move
White just moved his pawn to g3. Is he going to lose? }
1... hxg3+ { White draws because he knows that it’s unwinnable even if he ends up two pawns down: } 2. Kg2 (2. Kxg3?? Rg1+ $19) 2... Ke6 3. Rb8 Kxe5 4. Rb7 Kd6 5. Rb8 g4 6. fxg4 Ke5 7. Rb4 Kf6 8. Rb5 Kg6 9. Rb8 Kg5 10. Rg8+ Kf4 11. Rf8+ Kxg4 12. Rg8+ Kf5 13. Rf8+ Ke6 14. Re8+ $10 { Benjamin - Karpov, Cap d’ Agde 2000 } *


